            "line": 55,
            "text": "def energyPolynomial (d : TailData) (c : ℝ → Coeff) (A eta : ℝ) : ℝ :=\n  PulseAmplitude.quadraticCoefficient d.core * A ^ 2 +\n    PulseAmplitude.linearTerm d.core eta * A + constantTerm d c eta"
